   "speed": 1,
   "assembly": "Exact approved turns, 350 ms between turns, actual 30 s pre-read and 15 s finish PCM silence; MP3 encoded once after assembly. Two-pass loudness normalization from PCM master to review target, preserving silence and natural speech speed.",
   "cues": [
    {
     "kind": "instructions",
     "start": 0,
     "end": 9.47374149659864,
     "text": "This recording is copyright Brains Heist LLC. All rights reserved. Read questions A1 to A6. Notice the different word limits.",
     "voice": "Tom",
     "provider_task_id": "8a3b566c-13b5-488a-9eec-6309e18a6912",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "4998cd5de3b2fbc65a8090e96a3c3ca34878318ef5ccb0f15eab5d16f464d926"
    },
    {
     "kind": "reading_silence",
     "start": 9.47374149659864,
     "end": 39.47374149659864
    },
    {
     "kind": "speech",
     "segment": "A-01",
     "speaker": "Student",
     "voice": "James",
     "start": 39.47374149659864,
     "end": 42.67809523809524,
     "text": "I'd like to help with the school science display. When is it?",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "b1aadb562afe872b890aceb438bbe3d35bb7b999daefcf88ce1ed637bc23a6bb",
     "provider_task_id": "0ab48397-81f2-4a81-b7e3-3955cb65bf09"
    },
    {
     "kind": "speech",
     "segment": "A-02",
     "speaker": "Coordinator",
     "voice": "Paula",
     "start": 43.028072562358275,
     "end": 51.573015873015876,
     "text": "The display is in November. We are collecting project ideas during October, but the display itself is the following month.",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "117b76a4849cf7713bd1b799cc94d2bbaca76991ecc4af848ad5d743377e23e9",
     "provider_task_id": "5a7e79b3-7708-4f2e-9804-8658500c9204"
    },
    {
     "kind": "speech",
     "segment": "A-03",
     "speaker": "Student",
     "voice": "James",
     "start": 51.92299319727891,
     "end": 53.455510204081634,
     "text": "Who is leading the project?",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "d5a824942981be09f26cc3ba582980484edd33fc6434f3a1ab85472dafec4b78",
     "provider_task_id": "b46e68ec-5a3e-48d1-8e21-802d13e2aa7a"
    },
    {
     "kind": "speech",
     "segment": "A-04",
     "speaker": "Coordinator",
     "voice": "Paula",
     "start": 53.80548752834467,
     "end": 59.471156462585036,
     "text": "Ms Bramwell. That's B-R-A-M-W-E-L-L, with two Ls at the end.",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "f3bbea2d86ac4b773e5acb928896d12cdb639e8b991b66850aa199cef1a153d0",
     "provider_task_id": "6bffb46b-77f7-42d8-84f2-2b42cfaccacd"
    },
    {
     "kind": "speech",
     "segment": "A-05",
     "speaker": "Student",
     "voice": "James",
     "start": 59.82113378684807,
     "end": 61.30721088435374,
     "text": "What time should our team meet?",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "ab73a14ef20b17f4f13f1572de9e9347970fef63712906ee5d6d66bd23b02463",
     "provider_task_id": "885f8eb0-9533-4f84-90cf-c38a97f4ff11"
    },
    {
     "kind": "speech",
     "segment": "A-06",
     "speaker": "Coordinator",
     "voice": "Paula",
     "start": 61.65718820861678,
     "end": 70.01637188208616,
     "text": "Meet at nine forty in the morning to arrange your display. Visitors can enter from ten fifteen, so you'll have time to prepare.",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "9c9ac371f570dc87101fd10d2656b54282bc1ab99c34403e501856a2d1091906",
     "provider_task_id": "c04ad89e-2031-4c16-9922-05f57cc017b2"
    },
    {
     "kind": "speech",
     "segment": "A-07",
     "speaker": "Student",
     "voice": "James",
     "start": 70.36634920634921,
     "end": 72.03818594104308,
     "text": "How many teams are taking part?",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "f521d55bf5f345009b083b595d4a38830c32541b7c1fbd445f639d97891e0b31",
     "provider_task_id": "c96db5dd-7365-4456-aa49-79c2a79528e5"
    },
    {
     "kind": "speech",
     "segment": "A-08",
     "speaker": "Coordinator",
     "voice": "Paula",
     "start": 72.38816326530612,
     "end": 81.07242630385487,
     "text": "Twelve teams, with two students in each. That makes twenty-four students altogether, but just twelve separate displays.",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "ab3e079093476a926fc81ab2dd1f66f4ead69e278ad910cb5a8f876a9c51a6d2",
     "provider_task_id": "696965c4-a0c6-4102-aaf8-cd262971b410"
    },
    {
     "kind": "speech",
     "segment": "A-09",
     "speaker": "Student",
     "voice": "James",
     "start": 81.42240362811792,
     "end": 83.00136054421769,
     "text": "Do we need to buy paper and glue?",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "572d9a247d48bc0ccee2aceb30c4225839dbb9656269e51fe8318f652c1771cb",
     "provider_task_id": "5cf6509c-3671-4125-b06f-9d15c0ec6376"
    },
    {
     "kind": "speech",
     "segment": "A-10",
     "speaker": "Coordinator",
     "voice": "Paula",
     "start": 83.35133786848073,
     "end": 91.61764172335602,
     "text": "The school will provide paper. Please bring glue; we do not have enough for every team. You won't need any other materials.",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "10a82e0759090617a656c05b2694f4dbfb1b4540568ff94a587330b39d4ccf81",
     "provider_task_id": "98d6a5ce-3774-497a-a726-fab5e731a348"
    },
    {
     "kind": "speech",
     "segment": "A-11",
     "speaker": "Student",
     "voice": "James",
     "start": 91.96761904761905,
     "end": 94.19673469387754,
     "text": "Where will we prepare everything? In the gym?",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "c9cea7fc09cc638e733b202f7769bdc12ff1d42f1f7f61ce9953985dee500787",
     "provider_task_id": "7f03f2d7-275e-40b8-93a4-92f31a91e70c"
    },
    {
     "kind": "speech",
     "segment": "A-12",
     "speaker": "Coordinator",
     "voice": "Paula",
     "start": 94.5467120181406,
     "end": 102.48793650793651,
     "text": "We had planned to use the gym, but a class needs it. Go to the art room for preparation. The display will be in the hall.",
     "source_mp3_sha256": "a6e77b933fbaa4f12c00cdc740262fdb047abe75f1656f2f44b159591eb8cb47",
     "provider_task_id": "7e203ce8-8e70-464d-9e26-bde1dd685c31"
    },
    {
     "kind": "response_silence",
     "start": 102.48793650793651,
     "end": 117.48793650793651
    }
   ],
